# Lint Overview

`pnpm lint` → **0 errors, 309 warnings** in 129 files. All warnings = `react-hooks/*` (React Compiler rules). Grouped by rule, ordered easiest → hardest to fix.

**Effort key:** 🟢 trivial · 🟡 medium · 🟠 high · 🔴 very high

| # | Rule | Count | Effort | Description |
|---|------|------:|:------:|-------------|
| 1 | `react-hooks/static-components` | 11 | 🟢 | Component defined inside another component's render → new type each render, remounts subtree. Fix = hoist def to module scope. Mechanical, per-site. |
| 2 | `react-hooks/purity` | 5 | 🟢 | Impure work during render (mutation, `Date.now`/random, side effect). Fix = move into effect/event handler or memoize. Few sites, small. |
| 3 | `react-hooks/preserve-manual-memoization` | 10 | 🟡 | Manual `useMemo`/`useCallback` deps compiler can't preserve (deps don't match body). Fix = correct dep array or drop manual memo (compiler auto-memoizes). |
| 4 | `react-hooks/immutability` | 14 | 🟡 | Mutating props / state / hook return values directly. Fix = clone-then-set, no in-place mutation. Needs per-site data-flow check. |
| 5 | `react-hooks/refs` | 104 | 🟠 | Reading/writing `ref.current` during render (refs only valid in effects/handlers). High volume; each needs analysis — some are real render-time reads, restructure required. |
| 6 | `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` | 165 | 🔴 | `setState` inside `useEffect` → cascade re-render, sync bugs. Fix = derive during render, lift state, or `useMemo`. Biggest group + design rework per site. |

**Hot files:** `App.tsx` (19) · `TaskDetailPage.tsx` (15) · `rich-text-editor.tsx` (15, all refs) · `ArtifactsPanel.tsx` (14) · `BrowserPanel.tsx` (12) · `LayoutPreviews.tsx` (11, all static-components).
